                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "September is Childhood Cancer Awareness Month\ud83c\udf97\ufe0f\n\nSome cancers can only be treated at certain hospitals, which can be difficult for a lot of families. That\u2019s why I introduced the Accelerating Kids\u2019 Access to Care Act to help families who have to travel for their child's treatment.",
