                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For children and families facing rare pediatric diseases like cancer, the time between diagnosis and treatment is everything.\n\nI\u2019m proud that my bipartisan Accelerating Kids\u2019 Access to Care Act is now one step closer to becoming law! Onto the Senate!\nhttps://t.co/1bZqUCL233",
