                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too many families in America have had their world turned upside down by a brain tumor diagnosis. This morning, I joined @NBTStweets advocates to discuss my bipartisan BRAIN Act \u2013 legislation that will support treatment development and bring us one step closer to a cure. https://t.co/0h4REYXeCd",
